<view class="container vdot-page">
  <view class="hero-card vdot-hero">
    <view class="vdot-eyebrow">PERFORMANCE-BASED ESTIMATE</view>
    <view class="hero-title">VDOT 测算</view>
    <view class="hero-subtitle">用近期比赛成绩估算训练配速</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card input-card">
    <view class="section-title">比赛成绩</view>
    <view class="field-label">项目</view>
    <picker mode="selector" range="{{eventOptions}}" value="{{eventIndex}}" bindchange="onEventChange">
      <view class="selector-field">
        <text>{{eventOptions[eventIndex]}}</text>
        <text class="selector-arrow">⌄</text>
      </view>
    </picker>

    <view class="field-label time-label">完赛时间</view>
    <input
      class="time-input"
      placeholder="例如 40:00 或 1:32:40"
      placeholder-style="color:#74847f;"
      value="{{finishTime}}"
      maxlength="8"
      bindinput="onFinishTimeInput"
    />
    <view class="input-hint">仅需填写项目与完赛时间。</view>
    <view class="error-text" wx:if="{{errorText}}">{{errorText}}</view>
    <button class="btn-primary calculate-button" bindtap="onCalculate">开始测算</button>
  </view>

  <view class="card result-card" wx:if="{{result}}">
    <view class="result-head">
      <view>
        <view class="section-title result-title">你的 VDOT</view>
        <view class="result-source">基于{{result.eventLabel}} {{result.finishTime}} 测算</view>
      </view>
      <view class="vdot-score">{{result.vdot}}</view>
    </view>

    <view class="pace-heading">参考训练配速</view>
    <view class="pace-list">
      <view class="pace-row" wx:for="{{result.trainingPaces}}" wx:key="key">
        <view>
          <view class="pace-label">{{item.label}}</view>
          <view class="pace-description">{{item.description}}</view>
        </view>
        <view class="pace-value">{{item.pace}}</view>
      </view>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="method-note">
    VDOT 由比赛表现反推，不等同于实验室测得的 VO2max。训练配速仅供参考，请结合身体状态调整。
  </view>
</view>
